        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Scaling both diffusivities by s² moves the fastest wavelength almost linearly from about 110 µm to about 340 µm (figure C). The ablation Dv = Du kills the positive growth rate. The diffusion ratio itself is not walked as a second rendered morphospace on this pass." ;
